=== WHAT THIS PROVES (the Wave-5 runtime milestone) ===
The production C++ runtime implements the full flow: detect GPU arch -> select the
best cached kernel for a (gpu,op,shape) request -> load it -> serve (execute).
  - DeviceDetect (include/PolyKernel/Runtime/DeviceDetect.h): mockable arch detect.
    HipDeviceDetector calls hipGetDeviceProperties -> gcnArchName -> ParseGcnArchName
    ("gfx1101:sramecc+:xnack-" -> "gfx1101"); FixedArchDetector injects a fake arch
    so the gtest runs the selection logic with NO GPU.
  - KernelCache (KernelCache.h): maps (gpu,op,shape) -> best VALIDATED variant from
    the contract-H tuning DB (REUSES Todo 23 AmdTuningDb / Todo 24 TuningCache -
    NO new schema). Selection gates on validated:true; a miss is a clear typed error.
  - Runtime (Runtime.h): wires detect -> select -> load (registered launcher) ->
    serve. On a cache miss it returns "no tuned kernel ...; run the autotuner" -
    NEVER a wrong kernel, NEVER a crash.

