=== [2] ACCEPTANCE: on-GPU Runtime serves fused_matmul_bias_gelu via the cached best variant ===
The runtime loads the contract-H tuning DB (the Todo-25 bench winner for
gfx1101/fused_matmul_bias_gelu, best=(16,32,32,4,2,2,2), validated:true), detects
the GPU, selects the cached best variant for the requested (gpu,op,shape), loads the
compiled kernel (registered launch_fused_matmul_bias_gelu), and serves it.

Driver build (hipcc; Runtime selection logic + generated kernel + LLVMSupport parser):
  hipcc --offload-arch=gfx1101 -std=c++20 -DPOLYKERNEL_HIP -D__HIP_PLATFORM_AMD__ -O2 \
    -Iinclude -Ikernels/template -Ikernels/cpu \
    lib/Runtime/DeviceDetect.cpp lib/Runtime/KernelCache.cpp lib/Runtime/Runtime.cpp \
    lib/Runtime/HipRuntime.cpp kernels/cpu/npy_io.cpp \
    kernels/generated/fused_matmul_bias_gelu.cu w5_runtime_main.cpp \
    -x none build/lib/Autotune/libPolyKernelAutotune.a libLLVMSupport.a -lrt -ldl -lm libz libLLVMDemangle.a \
    -o w5_runtime
  -> exit 0 (clean compile + link).

